#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:654
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose the requested remote resolution from the presets, the current window "
"or screen size, or custom dimensions. Dynamic resizing requires "
"<application>spice-vdagent</application> in the guest. You can also enable "
"local scaling and audio playback. Clipboard exchange depends on support in "
"the guest."
