#: index.docbook:705
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This reads the server address, user name, domain, and a password field if "
"present; it does not import every setting supported by other RDP clients. "
"Use the host configuration dialog for other options. Run "
"<userinput><command>krdc</command> <option>--help</option></userinput> for "
"command-line help."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:714
#, no-c-format
msgid "Questions and Answers"
msgstr "प्रश्नोत्तरम्"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:717
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why is a protocol missing or an address rejected?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:718
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check that the corresponding plugin is installed and enabled in "
"<guilabel>Plugins</guilabel>, then restart &krdc;. Check the selected "
"protocol and address syntax in <xref linkend=\"compatible-versions\"/>. RDP "
"support uses the FreeRDP libraries directly; it does not require launching "
"an external <command>xfreerdp</command> executable."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:725
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why can I not connect to the remote computer?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:726
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check the host name, port, network or VPN connection, and whether the remote "
"desktop server is running. Ensure its firewall permits the connection. For "
"authentication failures, check your user name, password, domain, and "
"permission to log in remotely. If you use a proxy, gateway, or SSH tunnel, "
"check its settings and credentials too."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:733
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why can I see the desktop but not control it?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:734
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turn off <guimenuitem>View Only</guimenuitem> in the <guimenu>Session</"
"guimenu> menu. The server may also restrict your connection to viewing; ask "
"the person administering the remote desktop to check its permissions."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:740
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Why does <acronym>RDP</acronym> support not work?"
msgid "Why does copying and pasting not work?"
msgstr "<acronym>RDP</acronym> समर्थनं किमर्थं कार्यं न करोति ?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:741
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable <guimenuitem>Clipboard Sharing</guimenuitem>, disable "
"<guimenuitem>View Only</guimenuitem>, and check that the server supports the "
"content you are copying. For VNC, the password-manager filter can "
"deliberately block copied passwords. For SPICE, check the guest agent."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:747
#, no-c-format
msgid "How can I change settings after hiding the host dialog?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:748
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open <guilabel>Hosts</guilabel> in the application preferences, select the "
"host, and click <guibutton>Configure...</guibutton>. You can enable "
"<guilabel>Show this dialog again for this host</guilabel> there."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:753
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where can I report a problem?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:754
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Report bugs at <ulink url=\"https://bugs.kde.org\">the &kde; bug tracker</"
"ulink>. Include your &krdc; version, protocol, local operating system, "
"server software, and steps to reproduce the problem. Omit passwords and "
"other private connection details."
msgstr ""

